eb095e64-2bfd-41ff-9323-329db5ed58a0	Jal Abhishek Sewa	jal-abhishek-sewa	c8698af0-39ea-421a-97cd-a31e55cbb831	\N	151.00	251.00	40	Jal Abhishek is one of the simplest, yet most sacred forms of worship offered to Lord Shiva.	In this ritual, pure water—is continuously poured over the Shivling while chanting Shiva mantras such as "Om Namah Shivaya" or the Maha Mrityunjaya Mantra.	<p></p><p>According to the Shiva Purana and other Hindu scriptures, Lord Shiva is highly pleased by Jal Abhishek. This sacred offering symbolizes surrender, purification, devotion, and gratitude. It is believed that every drop of water offered to the Shivling washes away negative karma and invites divine blessings into the devotee's life.</p><h2><strong>Spiritual Significance of Jal Abhishek</strong></h2><ul><li><p>Water represents purity, peace, and the flow of life.</p></li><li><p>Offering water cools Lord Shiva's fiery energy and symbolizes calming one's own mind and emotions.</p></li><li><p>It signifies surrendering ego, anger, greed, and negativity at the feet of Mahadev.</p></li><li><p>Jal Abhishek helps devotees establish a deeper spiritual connection with Lord Shiva.</p></li><li><p>It is especially powerful during <strong>Shravan (Sawan) month</strong>, <strong>Mondays.</strong></p></li><li><p>Jal Abhishek is one of the most sacred and accessible forms of Shiva worship. It requires no elaborate preparations—only pure water and sincere devotion. Hindu scriptures describe it as a powerful act of faith that purifies the mind, strengthens spiritual connection, and invokes Lord Shiva's blessings for peace, prosperity, protection, and overall well-being. Whether performed daily or on auspicious occasions, Jal Abhishek remains a timeless practice of devotion that inspires inner transformation and divine grace.</p></li><li><p></p><p>For more details please call: <strong>9232158843, 8109181057.</strong></p></li></ul>	\N	\N	\N	\N	https://yajmanbucket.blr1.digitaloceanspaces.com//services/1787555108059-1730790552856.jpg	\N	\N	1	t	f	f	Book Jal Abhishek and Puja Omkareshwar Temple - Yajman App	For Jal Abhishek and Puja at Omkareshwar Jyotirlinga, Book Yajman Pandit Online through Yajman app or website.	0.00	0	0	0	3	published	e4e00abe-3b3a-4bdc-ae5c-cb5a249b0671	2026-08-24 07:05:08.17413+00	2026-09-02 12:02:26.81797+00	f	{"Reduce Family Dispute","Positive Energy","Positive Thinking","Carrer Growth"}	{"Attracts Lord Shiva's Blessings","Improves Health","Brings Family Harmony","Reduces the Effects of Planetary Doshas","Purifies Past Karma"}	2026-08-24	2026-10-23	specific_day	{2026-08-31,2026-09-07,2026-09-14,2026-09-21,2026-09-28,2026-10-05}	a632f7ac-ec4c-412a-9aa8-81c0bda455ba
