a2b7e170-dc9c-45f6-a67d-9bc9032f13ee	Shani Dev ji ka Pujan or Tel Arpan	shani-dev-ji-ka-pujan-or-tel-arpan	c8698af0-39ea-421a-97cd-a31e55cbb831	\N	501.00	651.00	23	Shani Dev Oil Abhishek is a sacred ritual dedicated to Shani Dev.	In this ritual, mustard oil is offered to Shani Dev while chanting Vedic mantras and prayers.	<p>Devotees perform this Abhishek to seek relief from the adverse effects of Shani, remove obstacles, and receive blessings for stability, justice, and prosperity.</p><h3><strong>Why is Shani Dev Oil Abhishek Performed?</strong></h3><ul><li><p>To reduce the malefic effects of Shani.</p></li><li><p>To seek relief from Shani Sade Sati, Dhaiya, and planetary afflictions.</p></li><li><p>To remove obstacles, delays, and hardships in life.</p></li><li><p>To attain peace, prosperity, and financial stability.</p></li><li><p>To overcome negative energies and fears.</p></li><li><p>To receive the blessings of Shani Dev for success and protection.</p><p></p></li></ul><h3><strong>Auspicious Time for Shani Dev Oil Abhishek:</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Saturdays</p></li><li><p>Shani Amavasya</p></li><li><p>Shani Jayanti</p></li><li><p>During Sade Sati or Shani Dhaiya.</p></li></ul><p></p><p><strong>Rituals:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Purification of the worship area</p></li><li><p>Sankalp</p></li><li><p>Offering mustard oil to Shani Dev</p></li><li><p>Recitation of Shani Mantras and Stotras</p></li><li><p>Offering black sesame seeds, flowers, and lamps</p></li><li><p>Aarti and prayers</p></li></ul><p></p><p>It is believed that sincere worship and Oil Abhishek of Shani Dev helps devotees overcome challenges, receive divine protection, and progress toward a balanced and successful life.</p><p><strong>|| Om Sham Shanicharaya Namah ||</strong></p><p></p><p>You will receive the <strong>video</strong> of your poojan at End of the day.</p><p>For more details please call: <strong>9232158843, 8109181057.</strong></p>	\N	\N	\N	\N	https://yajmanbucket.blr1.digitaloceanspaces.com//s