e148886f-4027-49de-9710-645b3068c7ba	Shree Ganesh Ji Pujan Samagri Kit	shree-ganesh-ji-pujan-samagri-kit	c8698af0-39ea-421a-97cd-a31e55cbb831	\N	751.00	801.00	6	Ganesh Ji Pujan holds a special place in Hindu tradition. This Ganesh Chaturthi bring eco-friendly Ganeshji to your home.	The Ganesh Ji Pujan Samagri Kit is a thoughtfully arranged collection of essential items required for performing Lord Ganesha Puja. It helps devotees organize the puja easily by bringing commonly required worship materials together in one convenient kit.	<p>Lord Ganesha, known as Vighnaharta (the remover of obstacles) and Pratham Pujya (the first deity to be worshipped), is traditionally worshipped before beginning auspicious activities, religious ceremonies, business ventures, educational pursuits, and important new beginnings.</p><p><strong>Ganesh Ji Visarjan Vidhi:</strong></p><p>Fill a large container or bucket with clean water. Gently and respectfully immerse the eco-friendly idol of Lord Ganesha in the water.</p><p>After one day, use this water to water your garden or potted plants. Within a few days, Bappa may appear in your home in the form of a Sindoor plant, symbolizing new beginnings and blessings.</p><p>The <strong>Ganesh Ji Pujan Samagri Kit</strong> makes it easier to organize the essential materials required for worship and helps devotees prepare for the puja in a simple and systematic way.</p><p>With devotion, faith and a sincere <strong>Shubh Sankalp</strong>, Ganesh Puja is traditionally performed to seek the blessings of Lord Ganesha for an auspicious beginning.</p><p></p><p>For more details Please call: 9232158843, <strong>8109181057.</strong></p><p></p>	\N	\N	\N	\N	https://yajmanbucket.blr1.digitaloceanspaces.com//services/1787832009036-WhatsApp%20Image%202026-08-27%20at%205.29.31%20PM.jpeg	\N	\N	1	t	t	f	Shree Ganesh Ji Pujan Samagri Kit	Book the ganesh ji pujan samagri kit for home and for other places. Ganesh ji idol.	0.00	0	0	0	12	published	e4e00abe-3b3a-4bdc-ae5c-cb5a249b0671	2026-08-27 06:28:26.078444+00	2026-09-02 12:18:08.822094+00	f	{"Blessings for Success","Removal of Obstacles","Prosperity and Good Fortune","Positive and Peaceful Environment","Auspicious New Beginnings"}	{"Complete Puja Essentials","Convenient & Ready to Use","Traditionally Used Puja Items","Eco Friendly Ganeshji","Suitable for home puja"}	2026-08-28	2026-09-14	all_day	{}	\N
dad3f73c-d785-4731-8f53-23ebd2ba4c20	Shiv Ji Aarti	shiv-ji-aarti	d7567720-7ffd-412d-a39d-bcd72ecd37f6	\N	\N	\N	\N	शिव जी की आरती	\N	<h2></h2><p><strong>भक्तिमय शिव जी की आरती</strong></p><p><strong>भगवान शिव की कृपा प्राप्त करने के लिए सोमवार को शिव जी की आरती का बहुत अधिक महत्व होता है। सोमवार के दिन भगवान शंकर की पूजा- अर्चना करने से सभी मनोकामनाएं पूरी हो जाती हैं।</strong></p><p><strong>भगवान शिव की कृपा प्राप्त करने के लिए प्रत्येक सोमवार को शिव जी की आरती करनी चाहिए।</strong></p><p><strong>॥आरती शिव जी की॥</strong></p><p><strong>जय शिव ओंकारा ॐ जय शिव ओंकारा।<br>ब्रह्मा विष्णु सदाशिव अर्द्धांगी धारा॥<br>ॐ जय शिव ओंकारा॥</strong></p><p><strong>एकानन चतुरानन पंचानन राजे ।<br>हंसानन गरुड़ासन वृषवाहन साजे ॥<br>ॐ जय शिव ओंकारा॥</strong></p><p><strong>दो भुज चार चतुर्भुज दस भुज अति सोहे।<br>त्रिगुण रूप निरखते त्रिभुवन जन मोहे ॥<br>ॐ जय शिव ओंकारा॥</strong></p><p><strong>अक्षमाला वनमाला रुण्डमाला धारी ।<br>चंदन मृगमद सोहै भाले शशिधारी ॥<br>ॐ जय शिव ओंकारा॥</strong></p><p><strong>श्वेताम्बर पीताम्बर बाघम्बर अंगे ।<br>सनकादिक गरुणादिक भूतादिक संगें ॥<br>ॐ जय शिव ओंकारा॥</strong></p><p><strong>कर के मध्य कमण्डलु चक्र त्रिशूल धर्ता ।<br>जग कर्ता जगभर्ता जग संहारकर्ता ॥<br>ॐ जय शिव ओंकारा॥</strong></p><p><strong>ब्रह्मा विष्णु सदाशिव जानत अविवेका ।<br>प्रणवाक्षर मध्ये ये तीनों एका ॥<br>ॐ जय शिव ओंकारा॥</strong></p><p><strong>काशी में विश्वनाथ विराजत नन्दी ब्रह्मचारी ।<br>नित उठि भोग लगावत महिमा अति भारी ॥<br>ॐ जय शिव ओंकारा॥</strong></p><p><strong>त्रिगुण शिवजी की आरती जो कोई नर गावे ।<br>कहत शिवानंद स्वामी मनवांछित फल पावे ॥<br>ॐ जय शिव ओंकारा॥</strong></p><p><strong>जय शिव ओंकारा हर ॐ शिव ओंकारा|<br>ब्रह्मा विष्णु सदाशिव अर्धांगी धारा॥<br>ॐ जय शिव ओंकारा॥</strong></p>	\N	\N	\N	\N	https://yajmanbucket.blr1.digitaloceanspaces.com/services/1788332259874-3.png	\N	\N	0	t	t	f	Shiv Ji Ki Arti	Read Shiv Ji ki Aarti	0.00	0	0	0	15	published	e4e00abe-3b3a-4bdc-ae5c-cb5a249b0671	2026-09-02 06:46:18.506513+00	2026-09-02 12:54:04.275788+00	f	{}	{}	\N	\N	all_day	{}	\N
a5adce94-b352-4766-a55a-75d81d8b160f	Special Hawan of Baglamukhi Maa	special-hawan-of-baglamukhi-maa	d4ba9d99-e393-469d-98b1-897ad5e5f6da	\N	5100.00	5500.00	7	Baglamukhi Hawan is a powerful Vedic fire ritual dedicated to Goddess Baglamukhi, one of the ten Mahavidyas.	Rituals Included in Baglamukhi Hawan:\r\nSankalp.\r\nGanesh Puja.\r\nMaa Baglamukhi puja.\r\nMantra Jaap.\r\nHawan.\r\nPurnahuti.\r\nAarti and prayers.\r\nPrasad Distribution.	<p><em>Book </em><strong><em>Special Hawan of Baglamukhi Maa</em></strong><em> at Nalkheda Kshetra.</em></p><p>Goddess Baglamukhi is revered as the deity who grants victory over enemies, removes obstacles, protects devotees from negative energies, and helps control harmful influences. The Hawan is performed by offering sacred materials into the holy fire while chanting Baglamukhi mantras.</p><h2>Why is Baglamukhi Hawan Performed?</h2><ul><li><p>To overcome enemies, opponents, and legal disputes.</p></li><li><p>To remove negative energies, black magic, and evil influences.</p></li><li><p>To attain victory in court cases, competitions, and professional challenges.</p></li><li><p>To gain courage, confidence, and mental strength.</p></li><li><p>To protect against accidents, hidden enemies, and unforeseen obstacles.</p></li><li><p>To improve focus, speech, and decision-making abilities.</p></li><li><p>To seek divine protection, prosperity, and success.</p></li></ul><p></p><h3><strong>Best Occasions for Baglamukhi Hawan:</strong></h3><ul><li><p>During legal disputes and court cases</p></li><li><p>Before important competitions or examinations</p></li><li><p>During periods of enemy-related troubles</p></li><li><p>To remove negative energies and obstacles</p></li><li><p>On auspicious days dedicated to Goddess Baglamukhi</p></li><li><p>During Navratri and special spiritual occasions.</p></li><li><p></p></li></ul><p><strong>Baglamukhi Hawan is performed with devotion and proper Vedic procedures to seek the blessings of Goddess Baglamukhi for protection, victory, success, and the removal of obstacles from life.</strong></p><p></p><p>For more details please call- <strong>9232158843, 8109181057.</strong></p>	\N	\N	\N	\N	https://yajmanbucket.blr1.digitaloceanspaces.com//services/1787562562562-1781096346729.png	\N	\N	2	t	t	t	Special Hawan of Baglamukhi Maa	माँ बगलामुखी मंदिर नलखेड़ा  का इतिहास, महत्व और यज्ञ-हवन की शक्ति जानें। मंत्र, पूजा विधि और विशेष धार्मिक अनुभव से पाएं माँ की कृपा|Baglamukhi Maa Nalkheda Hawan | Baglamukhi Hawan in Nalkheda | Baglamukhi Maa Nalkheda Yajna | Baglamukhi Havan Puja Nalkheda | Nalkheda Baglamukhi Temple Hawan	0.00	0	0	0	9	published	e4e00abe-3b3a-4bdc-ae5c-cb5a249b0671	2026-08-24 09:09:22.645653+00	2026-09-02 12:38:05.265686+00	f	{"Win over enemies","Protection from negativity"}	{"Victory over adversaries and competitors.","Spiritual growth and inner strength.","Peace, stability, and positive energy in life.","Success in business, career, and important endeavors.","Increased confidence and self-control."}	\N	\N	all_day	{}	\N
